	<LocalizedText>
		<Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_MER_THEODORIC_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Theodoric</Text>
		</Row>
		<!--Traits-->
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_MER_THEODORIC_GOTHORUM_ROMANORUMQUE" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Gothorum Romanorumque</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_MER_THEODORIC_GOTHORUM_ROMANORUMQUE_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>+50% [ICON_Production] Production towards districts in conquered cities, reduced by 10% for each specialty district already present in the city. Gain the Militond unique unit at Iron Working.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_UNIT_MER_MILITOND_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Militōnd</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_UNIT_MER_MILITOND_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>A unique land unit</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_MER_MILITOND_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Militōnd</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_MER_MILITOND_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Replaces the Swordsman.[NEWLINE]Doesn't require Iron. Free [ICON_Promotion] Promotion when trained, purchased, or upgraded from earlier unit. +10 [ICON_Strength] Strength in Gothic districts.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MODIFIER_MER_MILITOND_PROMOTION_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Roman Legacy</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MODIFIER_MER_MILITOND_PROMOTION_DESC" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Free Promotion</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MODIFIER_MER_MILITOND_DISTRICT_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Group of Hundred</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MODIFIER_MER_MILITOND_DISTRICT_DESC" Language="en_US">
			<Text>+10 [ICON_Strength] Strength in Gothic Districts.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_MER_GOTHIC_MIGRATION_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Gothic Migration</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_MER_GOTHIC_MIGRATION_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>When settling or conquering a city for the first time receive +1 [ICON_Citizen] Population in every Gothic city within 6 tiles.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_GOTHIC_MIGRATION_POP_GAIN" Language="en_US">
			<Text>City gains +{1: number #,###.#} [ICON_Citizen] population!</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_UNIT_MER_GADRAUHT_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Gadrauht</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_UNIT_MER_GADRAUHT_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>A unique land unit</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_MER_GADRAUHT_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Gadrauht</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_MER_GADRAUHT_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Replaces the Spearman.[NEWLINE]Higher Combat Strength and cheaper to produce. Combat victories grant [ICON_Culture] Culture equal to 50% of defeated unit's base combat strength. Can only be trained in cities with a [ICON_Citizen] Population of 2 of more. -1 [ICON_Citizen] Population in the city when built.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MODIFIER_MER_GADRAUHT_CULTURE_VICTORY_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Drauhtinon</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MODIFIER_MER_GADRAUHT_CULTURE_VICTORY_DESC" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Combat victories grant [ICON_Culture] Culture equal to 50% of defeated unit's base combat strength.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_BUILDING_MER_HLAIW_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hlaiw</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_BUILDING_MER_HLAIW_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>A unique building</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_BUILDING_MER_HLAIW_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hlaiw</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_BUILDING_MER_HLAIW_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Replaces the Shrine. [NEWLINE]+1 [ICON_Faith] Faith and +1 [ICON_Culture] Culture. Additional +0.25 [ICON_Faith] Faith and +0.25 [ICON_Culture] Culture per [ICON_Citizen] Citizen in this city.</Text>
		</Row>
